    "## 11. Conclusion\n",
    "\n",
    "This notebook compared three approaches for brain tumor classification from MRI scans:\n",
    "\n",
    "- **Custom CNN**: trained from scratch, fastest to train, a good baseline.\n",
    "- **VGG16 (transfer learning)**: leverages ImageNet features, typically improves accuracy over the scratch CNN with less training data needed.\n",
    "- **ResNet50 (transfer learning)**: deeper residual architecture, usually the strongest performer on this kind of task, at the cost of longer training time.\n",
    "\n",
    "The Grad-CAM add-on demonstrates *why* the model made each prediction, which is critical for\n",
    "building trust in AI-assisted diagnosis tools — a key theme raised in the literature review of\n",
    "this project (Kumar et al. 2023; Li et al. 2023 on explainability).\n",
    "\n",
    "**Actual accuracy numbers will depend on your training run** — record your own final test\n",
    "accuracies from Section 8 and report those on your resume/GitHub (do not reuse numbers from a\n",
    "different run).\n"
   ]
